<!--
  Hand-written, and correct at this size. Nine pages, one line each.
  See README.md, "Maintaining the sitemap" — a new page is added here in the
  same sitting it is created, or it does not get found.

  No <lastmod>, <changefreq> or <priority> on purpose. Search engines ignore
  the last two, and a hand-kept lastmod goes stale the first time someone
  edits a page and forgets this file — a date that is wrong is worse than one
  that is absent, because it is trusted. If a build step ever arrives and can
  stamp them accurately, that is the moment to add lastmod, not before.

  Not listed, deliberately: 404.html, which is an error page and must never
  be offered as a destination.
-->
